WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.002
Today is the last of the eight sounds.

2
00:00:02.452 --> 00:00:05.031
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:05.531 --> 00:00:07.538
Old sounds first. All seven.

4
00:00:08.866 --> 00:00:09.693
As in moon.

5
00:00:11.192 --> 00:00:12.058
As in nest.

6
00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:18.005
Now the new one.

7
00:00:19.123 --> 00:00:21.871
As in dog. Pat your knee, like calling a dog.

8
00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:28.326
It is a quick sound, like the two from day three. Here are the three quick ones together.

9
00:00:31.505 --> 00:00:34.446
Keep each one tiny, with nothing added on the end.

10
00:00:34.896 --> 00:00:38.003
Now the words. Today most of them have three sounds.

11
00:00:41.382 --> 00:00:42.357
The word is sad.

12
00:00:46.017 --> 00:00:47.014
The word is dip.

13
00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:52.479
Read the first word together. Then press play on the sound track, and step away.

14
00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:57.483
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Now all eight sounds have been met.
